## 🧮 SYSTEM FORMULAS & CONFIGURATION

### 1. Costing & Selling Price Formula
$$\text{Selling Price} = (\text{Material Cost} + \text{Man Power Cost}) \times (1 + \text{Overhead}\%) \times (1 + \text{Profit Margin}\%) + \text{Shipping}$$

*   **Overhead Rate:** 15% (`0.15`)
*   **Profit Margin:** 20% (`0.20`)
*   **Man Power (MP) Cost per Unit (Static Config):**
    *   Cutting: Rp 5,000
    *   Sewing: Rp 15,000
    *   Finishing: Rp 8,000
    *   QC: Rp 3,000
    *   Packing: Rp 2,000
    *   **Total Man Power:** **Rp 33,000**
*   **Shipping Costs per Unit (Destination-Based):**
    *   Jakarta: Rp 5,000
    *   Jawa (non-Jakarta): Rp 8,000
    *   Luar Jawa: Rp 12,000
    *   Export (US / Canada): Rp 35,000

### 2. Project Type Transitions
*   **PROTO** $\xrightarrow{\text{Approve}}$ Auto-create **SAMPLE**
    *   Copies Project, Merchandising, PO, Production, QC, and Invoices.
    *   *ALL* copied data remains fully editable.
*   **SAMPLE** $\xrightarrow{\text{Approve}}$ Auto-create **MASS**
    *   Copies all sample data + Shipment Tracking information.
    *   *ALL* copied data remains fully editable.
*   **Duplicate Button:** Creates a new project of the same type (for repeat/re-orders next year) copyable and fully editable.

