## 💻 DEVELOPMENT COMMANDS
Keep these commands in mind when executing migrations, testing, or building:
```bash
composer dev                          # Launch dev environment (serve + queue + logs + vite)
php artisan serve                     # Laravel server only (localhost:8000)
npm run dev                           # Vite server only
php artisan migrate                   # Run migrations
php artisan migrate:fresh --seed     # Rebuild DB with complete demo data
php artisan db:seed                   # Seed demo data
php artisan test                      # Run PHPUnit test suite
./vendor/bin/pint                     # Clean & format PHP code conventions
```

